Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-shut up! This is my first time fighting a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never fought a monster, but you wander into a forest? That's just plain stupid! What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Now you're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're afraid of getting hurt, then there's no way you'll get stronger! No pain, no gain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to teach you? Who's your opponent? I'll train you so you can beat him in less than a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that move you taught me was amazing! You should have seen the look on Hugo's face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary how much you've improved!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. If you can beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can win now, but where did she go?
